{"title":"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Eric plans to compete in a triathlon. He can average <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />-mile swim and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-mile run. His goal is to finish the triathlon in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours. To accomplish his goal what must his average speed in miles per hour, be for the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-mile bicycle ride?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcfa54908e39bf3d85c1a81c6700570d0b25f0ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{120}{11} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 11 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{56}{5} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{45}{4} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"408\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1218dbfae7805ea5564ac7ee2a892d0a846653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=rt$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, Eric takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/a/6aacfa503ea0e2162dff1c630f3103a64b002447.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{2}=\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" /> hours for the swim. Then, he takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/1523a4d3333b31c89da6e84ea4c313f2aa15850e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{6}=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" /> hours for the run. \n</p><p>So he needs to take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b680583454ac77930bd09143fbff4a7e3f8f0865.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-\\frac{5}{8}=\\frac{11}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" /> hours for the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mile bike. This is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/c/c5c4a867767e25284842b60b5b99217cf68d0bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{\\frac{11}{8}}=\\frac{120}{11} \\frac{\\text{miles}}{\\text{hour}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/e/67e21a92ae1b8c2473863b39b7a845e1fc691114.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\longrightarrow \\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A\">2009 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC